<p>I love the mental picture of a bunch of eggs helping out with cooking, and the story told is quite entertaining. There are a few places with odd jumps<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-366154-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-366154-1')">1</a></sup>, but nothing that derails the read-through significantly.</p>
